   "key": "§ HRV reference data > Three differences that are not defects",
   "hash": "df38e0ec045ed4a9",
   "does": "Documents three places a plain reference implementation disagrees with the app without an app defect: SDNN uses N-1; computeTimeDomain gates ectopics (nsr005: 15.96 against 28.98), so the test compares the unfiltered reference against rmssd(fromCleanRRs:) and recomputes the pipeline RMSSD from the kept adjacent pairs, asserting no direction and only that the gate changes at least one record; mean HR comes from rolling 10-second windows, so the test asserts agreement in scale (tolerance max(2.0, 5%)); computeHRStatistics uses stored sensor HR when every clean beat carries it, then rolling-window HR, then the meanRR fallback.",
